        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Boll's Journey</i> is a top-down puzzle adventure where you play as Boll — a mysterious glowing sphere with a past, a purpose, and a not-so-obvious future. Fight your way through hostile Shapes, solve puzzles, outrun Appearing Shapes, weave through bush-filled mazes, and uncover a cryptic story across shape-infested battlefields and surreal dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles &amp; Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use as little energy as possible to make it as far as you can. Hit Buttons (in the right order) to pass through gates, or eliminate (or leave) the right Shapes to unlock the path forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/ac4885309ed226035c4dfb27a3bc1172.poster.avif?t=1756557616\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/ac4885309ed226035c4dfb27a3bc1172.webm?t=1756557616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/ac4885309ed226035c4dfb27a3bc1172.mp4?t=1756557616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nature vs Geometry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature pushes back against the Shapes' expansion, forming maze-like paths and chaotic battle zones. Be careful not to get caught in the crossfire between wild terrain and synthetic invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/61771402c319b3b774231d40387f0639.poster.avif?t=1756557616\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/61771402c319b3b774231d40387f0639.webm?t=1756557616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/61771402c319b3b774231d40387f0639.mp4?t=1756557616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story &amp; Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through gardens, parks, suburbs, cities, jungles, and beyond in a seemingly never-ending journey — slowly piecing together what Boll is, why you're helping them, where the Shapes came from, and what it all means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/6088f1fa4a1da643b4c3f060d7a62b29.poster.avif?t=1756557616\" width=632 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/6088f1fa4a1da643b4c3f060d7a62b29.webm?t=1756557616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/6088f1fa4a1da643b4c3f060d7a62b29.mp4?t=1756557616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voices will whisper. Some will guide. Others may deceive. Who do you trust?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Changing landscapes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is vast and always shifting. You'll explore:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gardens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suburbs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…with more regions planned for future updates.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Boll's Journey</i> is a top-down puzzle adventure where you play as Boll — a mysterious glowing sphere with a past, a purpose, and a not-so-obvious future. Fight your way through hostile Shapes, solve puzzles, outrun Appearing Shapes, weave through bush-filled mazes, and uncover a cryptic story across shape-infested battlefields and surreal dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles &amp; Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use as little energy as possible to make it as far as you can. Hit Buttons (in the right order) to pass through gates, or eliminate (or leave) the right Shapes to unlock the path forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/ac4885309ed226035c4dfb27a3bc1172.poster.avif?t=1756557616\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/ac4885309ed226035c4dfb27a3bc1172.webm?t=1756557616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/ac4885309ed226035c4dfb27a3bc1172.mp4?t=1756557616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nature vs Geometry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature pushes back against the Shapes' expansion, forming maze-like paths and chaotic battle zones. Be careful not to get caught in the crossfire between wild terrain and synthetic invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/61771402c319b3b774231d40387f0639.poster.avif?t=1756557616\" width=632 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/61771402c319b3b774231d40387f0639.webm?t=1756557616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/61771402c319b3b774231d40387f0639.mp4?t=1756557616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story &amp; Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through gardens, parks, suburbs, cities, jungles, and beyond in a seemingly never-ending journey — slowly piecing together what Boll is, why you're helping them, where the Shapes came from, and what it all means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/6088f1fa4a1da643b4c3f060d7a62b29.poster.avif?t=1756557616\" width=632 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/6088f1fa4a1da643b4c3f060d7a62b29.webm?t=1756557616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851560/extras/6088f1fa4a1da643b4c3f060d7a62b29.mp4?t=1756557616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voices will whisper. Some will guide. Others may deceive. Who do you trust?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Changing landscapes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is vast and always shifting. You'll explore:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gardens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suburbs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…with more regions planned for future updates.</p>",
